              %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:MainTheoremPerturbativeRenormalizationInductionStep"} (?)
              in the proof of the
              %a.existingWikiWord{:href => "/nlab/show/main+theorem+of+perturbative+renormalization"} main theorem of perturbative renormalization
              (theorem
              = succeed ")." do
                %a.maruku-ref{:href => "#PerturbativeRenormalizationMainTheorem"}
            %p
              In this notation we need to find
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi 𝒵
                      %mi Λ
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} \mathcal{Z}_\Lambda
              such that for each
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mi n
                    %mo ∈
                    %mi ℕ
