                    \\,.
            %p
              Here in the first step we inserted the causal decomposition
              %a.maruku-eqref{:href => "#eq:TimeOrderedProductsAwayFromDiagonalByInduction"} (?)
              of
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %msub
                      %mi T
                      %mrow
                        %mi n
                        %mo +
                        %mn 1
                  %annotation{:encoding => "application/x-tex"} T_{n+1}
              in terms of the
              %math.maruku-mathml{:display => "inline", :xmlns => "http://www.w3.org/1998/Math/MathML"}
                %semantics
                  %mrow
                    %mo{:stretchy => "false"} {
